{"id":"1cb489a34bc2433c","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-logic-satisfaction-relation.md","title":"ZFC Logic Satisfaction Relation","display":"df-zfc-logic-satisfaction-relation — ZFC Logic Satisfaction Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-logic-satisfaction-relation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-logic-satisfaction-relation","58-df-zfc-model-satisfaction-relation","58-df-zfc-model2-satisfaction-relation","58-df-zfc-model6-satisfaction-relation"],"display":"df-zfc-logic-satisfaction-relation — ZFC Logic Satisfaction Relation","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-term.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-logic-satisfaction-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-logic-satisfaction-relation</span><span>58-df-zfc-model-satisfaction-relation</span><span>58-df-zfc-model2-satisfaction-relation</span><span>58-df-zfc-model6-satisfaction-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-logic-satisfaction-relation — ZFC Logic Satisfaction Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"db7ec154138d5972\" href=\"?note=db7ec154138d5972\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-term.md\">../batch05/58-df-term.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"445e1cd0bb5274eb\" href=\"?note=445e1cd0bb5274eb\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md\">../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A}\\in V\">\\(\\Sigma,\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cnst}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},a_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},a_{\\mathrm{rel}})\">\\(\\Sigma=(\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cnst}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},a_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},a_{\\mathrm{rel}})\\)</span> (a first-order signature)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\Sigma)\\)</span> (structure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (the term and formula sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> (the universe of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak A,s)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak A,s)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s[x\\mapsto a]\">\\(s[x\\mapsto a]\\)</span> (assignment and update, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I^{\\mathfrak A}_{\\mathrm{cst}},I^{\\mathfrak A}_{\\mathrm{fun},n},I^{\\mathfrak A}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}\">\\(I^{\\mathfrak A}_{\\mathrm{cst}},I^{\\mathfrak A}_{\\mathrm{fun},n},I^{\\mathfrak A}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}\\)</span> (the interpretation maps of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TermEvaluation}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{TermEvaluation}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (term-evaluation predicate defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogicSatisfactionRelation}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogicSatisfactionRelation}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}assignment\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Asn}(\\mathfrak A)\\coloneqq\n\\{s\\in V:\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak A,s)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}assignment\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Asn}(\\mathfrak A)\\coloneqq\n\\{s\\in V:\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak A,s)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}term\\text{-}evaluation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TermEvaluation}_S(\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A},\\mathfrak A,\\Sigma)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A},\n\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\times\\operatorname{Asn}(\\mathfrak A),\n\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall s\\in\\operatorname{Asn}(\\mathfrak A)\\;\\Bigl[\n\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A}(x,s)=s(x)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{17mm}{}\\land\n\\forall c\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cnst}}\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A}(c,s)\n=I^{\\mathfrak A}_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{17mm}{}\\land\n\\forall f\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}}\\;\n\\forall\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^{a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f)}\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A}(f(\\vec t),s)\n=I^{\\mathfrak A}_{\\mathrm{fun},a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f)}(f)\n\\bigl(\\langle\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A}(t_i,s):\ni&lt;a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f)\\rangle\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}term\\text{-}evaluation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TermEvaluation}_S(\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A},\\mathfrak A,\\Sigma)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A},\n\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\times\\operatorname{Asn}(\\mathfrak A),\n\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall s\\in\\operatorname{Asn}(\\mathfrak A)\\;\\Bigl[\n\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A}(x,s)=s(x)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{17mm}{}\\land\n\\forall c\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cnst}}\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A}(c,s)\n=I^{\\mathfrak A}_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{17mm}{}\\land\n\\forall f\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}}\\;\n\\forall\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^{a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f)}\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A}(f(\\vec t),s)\n=I^{\\mathfrak A}_{\\mathrm{fun},a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f)}(f)\n\\bigl(\\langle\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A}(t_i,s):\ni&lt;a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f)\\rangle\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}satisfaction\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogicSatisfactionRelation}_S(\n\\mathcal R,\\mathfrak A,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A},\\Sigma)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\Sigma)\n\\land\\mathrm{TermEvaluation}_S(\n\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A},\\mathfrak A,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\n\\mathcal R\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\times\\operatorname{Asn}(\\mathfrak A)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall s\\in\\operatorname{Asn}(\\mathfrak A)\\;\\Bigl[\n\\forall t_1,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle t_1\\doteq t_2,s\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A}(t_1,s)\n=\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A}(t_2,s)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9mm}{}\\land\n\\forall P\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\;\n\\forall\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^{a_{\\mathrm{rel}}(P)}\\;\n\\Bigl(\\langle P(\\vec t),s\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A}(t_i,s):\ni&lt;a_{\\mathrm{rel}}(P)\\rangle\n\\in I^{\\mathfrak A}_{\\mathrm{rel},a_{\\mathrm{rel}}(P)}(P)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9mm}{}\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle\\neg\\varphi,s\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R\n\\leftrightarrow\\langle\\varphi,s\\rangle\\notin\\mathcal R\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9mm}{}\\land\n\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle\\varphi\\lor\\psi,s\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R\n\\leftrightarrow\n(\\langle\\varphi,s\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R\n\\lor\\langle\\psi,s\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9mm}{}\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\n\\Bigl(\\langle\\forall x\\,\\varphi,s\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\\;\n\\langle\\varphi,s[x\\mapsto a]\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}satisfaction\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogicSatisfactionRelation}_S(\n\\mathcal R,\\mathfrak A,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A},\\Sigma)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\Sigma)\n\\land\\mathrm{TermEvaluation}_S(\n\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A},\\mathfrak A,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\n\\mathcal R\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\times\\operatorname{Asn}(\\mathfrak A)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall s\\in\\operatorname{Asn}(\\mathfrak A)\\;\\Bigl[\n\\forall t_1,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle t_1\\doteq t_2,s\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A}(t_1,s)\n=\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A}(t_2,s)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9mm}{}\\land\n\\forall P\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\;\n\\forall\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^{a_{\\mathrm{rel}}(P)}\\;\n\\Bigl(\\langle P(\\vec t),s\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A}(t_i,s):\ni&lt;a_{\\mathrm{rel}}(P)\\rangle\n\\in I^{\\mathfrak A}_{\\mathrm{rel},a_{\\mathrm{rel}}(P)}(P)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9mm}{}\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle\\neg\\varphi,s\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R\n\\leftrightarrow\\langle\\varphi,s\\rangle\\notin\\mathcal R\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9mm}{}\\land\n\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle\\varphi\\lor\\psi,s\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R\n\\leftrightarrow\n(\\langle\\varphi,s\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R\n\\lor\\langle\\psi,s\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9mm}{}\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\n\\Bigl(\\langle\\forall x\\,\\varphi,s\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\\;\n\\langle\\varphi,s[x\\mapsto a]\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\varphi,s\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R\">\\(\\langle\\varphi,s\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R\\)</span> is the set-coded meaning of “<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span> satisfies <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> under <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span>”; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A}(t,s)\">\\(\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A}(t,s)\\)</span> abbreviates evaluation at the ordered pair <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle t,s\\rangle\">\\(\\langle t,s\\rangle\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The clauses cover equality atoms, relation atoms, negation, disjunction, and universal quantification—the complete constructor basis used by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>.</li>\n<li>Induction on term depth and formula depth gives uniqueness of both the evaluation function and the satisfaction relation.</li>\n<li>The legacy model-satisfaction labels remain frontmatter aliases for this single four-place predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-term.md","status":"resolved","id":"db7ec154138d5972","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-term.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md","status":"resolved","id":"445e1cd0bb5274eb","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\Sigma)$ (structure predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"